bandon the mission by calling for an evac. You don’t get penalized for leaving early, but you do face a large charge to restore your skills if the bugs get you. As a mercenary, you should feel no shame in admitting a battle is not worth it to your bank account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616200/extras/environment.gif?t=1787771325\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive, Varied, and Moody Open Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unscripted gameplay through outdoor worlds that don't play like claustrophobic rooms without ceilings. You're free to go wherever they want whenever they want. Well, except for lava and bottomless cannons. You can only go there once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616200/extras/bugs.gif?t=1787771325\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bugs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not much is known about the Bugs other than they don’t like humans very much and they are telepathic. They also disrupt much of the technology humanity relies upon, requiring you to take them out &quot;old school&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dive into massive, open alien environments to rescue, recover, and battle in the name of Humanity and profit. Select a mission, customize your equipment, drop, strike, and evac to space (if you can). Enjoy the physics based 1st person tactical shooter in VR or 2D, single player or in 4 player co-op.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616